Mailed From: Pearl, Illinois on September 7, 1990&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;br&gt;
Pike Co.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dear Bessie~&lt;br&gt;
Wish you many many happy birthdays.&lt;br&gt;
Your Friend,&lt;br&gt;
Hetty W.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
